  "description": "Seven years ago, the \"Frog Tribe\", who look like frogs, appeared in South Korea. In a society full of hostility and hatred toward them, the main character, \"Lee Jeong-U\", aims to maintain a happy family with his wife and daughter. Then one day, a frog tribe moves into the house next door and terrible things happen.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
